<title>POLAND: ZYWIEC 9.9 PCT SURGE SURPRISES TRADERS.</title>
<headline>ZYWIEC 9.9 PCT SURGE SURPRISES TRADERS.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-11-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Polish brewer Zywiec SA soared 9.9 percent in a low 0.7-million-zloty turnover to 149.5 zlotys but analysts could not explain such a surge.</p>
<p>&quot;It did fall recently, so the price was attractive, but it's still difficult to say why the jump was so spectacular... but the turnover was rather low, so it might be accidental,&quot; one trader said.</p>
<p>Zywiec fell 9.3 percent in the November 19-25 period.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
